  "title": "Do you have…?",
  "goal": "Say what you have and don't have with a possessive and var or yok.",
  "points": ["gp-possessive-have", "gp-possessive-suffixes"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Turkish has no verb **to have**. Put the possessive on the thing and add *var* or *yok*: *Arabam var* (I have a car), *Zamanım yok* (I don't have time), *Kardeşin var mı?* (Do you have siblings?)",
    "see": "gp-possessive-have"
  },
